   "t1": 247.25,
   "end": 247.6,
   "text": "The cliché is a great example. For ordinary conversation, the more people use it, the better it works as shorthand. For a writer, every use wears it out. It's a thrindle and the opposite at once, depending on the user.",
   "speech": "The cliché is a great example. For ordinary conversation, the more people use it, the better it works as shorthand. For a writer, every use wears it out. It's a thrindle and the opposite at once, depending on the user.",
