   "kind": "item",
   "spoken": true,
   "t0": 297.83,
   "t1": 308.15,
   "end": 308.5,
   "text": "3. **Stability.** Concepts should apply consistently across contexts. Your frog chart shows my kind shifting answers with the register of the conversation.",
   "speech": "3. Stability. Concepts should apply consistently across contexts. Your frog chart shows my kind shifting answers with the register of the conversation.",
