   "kind": "item",
   "spoken": true,
   "t0": 308.5,
   "t1": 321.7,
   "end": 322.05,
   "text": "4. **Behavior underdetermines.** Block's \"Blockhead,\" a giant lookup table, could pass any finite test. So my passing your thrindle probe proves competence, not concepts.",
